@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

' Domain styling with frames
skinparam frame {
  BackgroundColor #E1BEE7
  BorderColor #9370DB
  BorderThickness 2
  FontColor black
  FontSize 11
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam queue {
  BackgroundColor #FFE4B5
  BorderColor #666666
  FontSize 10
}

skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
}

' Domains as frames
frame "AccountManagement" as AccountManagement
frame "BalanceTracking" as BalanceTracking
frame "CustomerNotification" as CustomerNotification
frame "PaymentProcessing" as PaymentProcessing

' Actors
actor "CRON" as CRON
actor "Customer" as Customer
actor "TransactionValidation" as TransactionValidation

' Domain queues
queue "BalanceTracking events" as BalanceTracking_events
queue "CustomerNotification events" as CustomerNotification_events
queue "PaymentProcessing events" as PaymentProcessing_events
queue "TransactionValidation events" as TransactionValidation_events

' Workflow flows
Customer --> PaymentProcessing : 1. initiates transfer
PaymentProcessing ->> AccountManagement : 2. to verify source account
PaymentProcessing ->> TransactionValidation : 3. to check transfer limits
TransactionValidation -> TransactionValidation : 4. validates transaction rules
PaymentProcessing ->> BalanceTracking : 5. to reserve funds
BalanceTracking ->> BalanceTracking_events : 6. Funds Reserved
BalanceTracking_events --> PaymentProcessing : 7. Funds Reserved
PaymentProcessing ->> AccountManagement : 8. to verify destination account
PaymentProcessing -> PaymentProcessing : 9. executes fund transfer
BalanceTracking -> BalanceTracking : 10. updates account balances
PaymentProcessing ->> PaymentProcessing_events : 11. Transfer Completed
PaymentProcessing_events --> CustomerNotification : 12. Transfer Completed
CustomerNotification -> CustomerNotification : 13. sends confirmation to both accounts
Customer --> AccountManagement : 14. checks balance
AccountManagement ->> BalanceTracking : 15. to get current balance
BalanceTracking -> BalanceTracking : 16. calculates available balance
AccountManagement --> Customer : 17. returns balance information
TransactionValidation ->> AccountManagement : 18. to freeze account
AccountManagement -> AccountManagement : 19. applies security hold
TransactionValidation ->> TransactionValidation_events : 20. Account Frozen
TransactionValidation_events --> CustomerNotification : 21. Account Frozen
CustomerNotification -> CustomerNotification : 22. sends security alert to customer
CustomerNotification ->> CustomerNotification_events : 23. bank security team
CRON --> PaymentProcessing : 24. triggers scheduled payments
PaymentProcessing ->> AccountManagement : 25. to get scheduled payments
PaymentProcessing -> PaymentProcessing : 26. processes each scheduled payment
BalanceTracking -> BalanceTracking : 27. updates balances for processed payments
PaymentProcessing ->> PaymentProcessing_events : 28. Scheduled Payments Processed

@enduml